<title>JAPAN: Stock ratings list-Yamaichi Research (Jul 14).</title>
<headline>Stock ratings list-Yamaichi Research (Jul 14).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Follows is a list of ratings on Monday by Yamaichi Research Institute of Securities and Economics Inc.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>First time rated:</p>
<p>Toto Ltd -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Takefuji Co Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Rating unchanged:</p>
<p>Asahi Breweries Ltd -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The research institute assigns ratings as follows:</p>
<p>&quot;1&quot; - issues expected to outperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
<p>&quot;2&quot; - issues seen moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of tthe Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;3&quot; - issues expected to underperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
